/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 129 0 R
/E (To systematically neutralize these critical vulnerabilities and safeguard the institution's digital ecosystem, the primary and most vital immediate action required is the strict enforcement of advanced access controls and robust authentication mechanisms. This involves mandating Multi-Factor Authentication \(MFA\) across all administrative and user accounts, alongside the implementation of strict, unique password policies. Concurrently, the technical team must execute an emergency deployment of missing server security patches, temporarily restrict or secure all remote access entry points, and establish a continuous, non-exploitative vulnerability-scanning routine. Pairing these technical remediations with ongoing security monitoring and proactive threat intelligence will ensure long-term system resilience, protect data integrity, and maintain a secure, trusted learning environment for all stakeholders.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
